<title>USA: Chock Full O'Nuts Q3 April 30 net rises.</title>
<headline>Chock Full O'Nuts Q3 April 30 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.21		    $0.09</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 0.15		     0.08</p>
<p> Net			  2,236			968</p>
<p> Revs			95,829		   86,130</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.51		    $0.26</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 0.39		     0.26</p>
<p> Net			  5,435		    2,741</p>
<p> Revs		     262,125		  245,232</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTES: Full company name is Chock Full O'Nuts Corp/</p>
<p>The company said 1996 Q3 results included a loss from discontinued operations of $492,000 or $0.05 per share.</p>
<p>First 9 months from 1996 included a loss from discontinued operations of $1,463,000 or $0.13 per share, it said.</p>
